name: Erratic Ace Spike — many Aces
author: corpus
description: >-
  Erratic Deck starting deck with at least 13 Aces, a 25% rank spike for Scholar,
  Superposition, and X-of-a-kind hands. RAG aliases: erratic aces, many Aces,
  ace pile, high-card ace build, funny rank clump.
deck: Erratic
stake: White
must:
  - erraticRank: Ace
    min: 13
should:
  - joker: Scholar
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 55
  - joker: Superposition
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: TheTrio
    label: "Three of a Kind payoff from Ace density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
  - joker: TheFamily
    label: "Four/Five of a Kind payoff from Ace density"
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
